# Validation 05: LOAD/STORE through the CDB.
# The LOAD reads mem[100] (10) into R6, the ADD adds 3
# (R3=3) to make 13, the STORE writes 13 back to mem[104].
# The chain exercises the LOAD/STORE forwarding path and
# shows that the architectural memory reflects the most
# recent committed value.
LOAD R6, 100(R0)
ADD R6, R6, R3
STORE R6, 104(R0)
h
